# The screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and what Mocky shows and does is said once:
# which picture this is, a picture arriving from the page, the notes, the slideshow, the gallery cleared.
# (tests/host/mock_test.mjs writes the pictures.)
wait 200
listen
wait 100
said Mocky, pictures for the FM-1 screen. No picture shown. Gallery empty, 275 KB free. Plug in USB and open the Mocky page in Chrome to send one
expect hellos 1

# pictures from the page: kept, and not kept
send build/host/pics/ui.syx
said New picture, kept as picture 1 of 1
send build/host/pics/second.syx
said New picture, kept as picture 2 of 2
send build/host/pics/gradient-live.syx
said New picture, not kept. Press SAVE to keep it
tap HOME
said Picture not kept, 2 in the gallery
tap SAVE
said Kept as picture 3 of 3
tap SAVE
said ALREADY KEPT

# the reader's SysEx and Mocky's own on the same port: the reader's is taken first, Mocky's still answered
raw F0 7D 53 52 03 F7
said Picture 3 of 3. 235 KB free
send build/host/pics/info.syx
send build/host/pics/show0.syx
said Picture 1 of 3
expect cur 0

# stepping: the buttons at once, a knob once it settles, the keys
tap OCT+
said Picture 2 of 3
turn SELECT 1
wait 200
said Picture 3 of 3
tapkey w0
said Picture 1 of 3
tapkey w5
said NO PICTURE 6
tap HOME
said Picture 1 of 3,
# slideshow: PLAY, KNOB 4 its pace, the pictures as it moves on
tap PLAY
said Slideshow on, EVERY 3 S
turn K4 -1
wait 200
said SLIDESHOW EVERY 2 S
wait 2100
said Picture 2 of 3
where
said Slideshow on, EVERY 2 S
tap PLAY
said SLIDESHOW OFF
# a picture from the page stops the slideshow
tap PLAY
send build/host/pics/ui.syx
said New picture, kept as picture 4 of 4. Slideshow off
expect slideshow 0

# warnings: the gallery full (the picture shown, not kept), SAVE then
send build/host/pics/noise.syx
send build/host/pics/noise.syx
send build/host/pics/noise.syx 4
said New picture shown, not kept: GALLERY FULL
tap SAVE
said Not kept: GALLERY FULL

# the page clears the gallery: the picture on the screen stays, not kept
send build/host/pics/clear.syx
said Gallery cleared. The picture on the screen is not kept
tap PLAY
said No slideshow: keep two pictures first
tap OCT+
said Picture not kept
reboot
tap SAVE
said Not kept: no new picture to keep
tap OCT-
said No pictures kept
where
said No picture shown. Gallery empty
